<title>BELGIUM: WTO finds against Japan on liquor tax - EU official.</title>
<headline>WTO finds against Japan on liquor tax - EU official.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Trade Organisation has found against Japan in a case brought by the European Union over Tokyo's taxes on liquor imports, an EU official said.</p>
<p>&quot;Our understanding is the WTO found against Japan,&quot; an official at the European Commission said. &quot;We are now working on a response&quot;.</p>
<p>The European Commission -- the EU's executive -- launched a WTO procedure against Japan earlier this year to protest against what it said were unfair taxes on spirits, including whisky and brandy.</p>
<p>-- David Fox, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6832, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
